---
layout: page.njk
permalink: /index.html
title: tilliX, Nudge CPaaS, tilliPay | Enterprise Billing & Payment Platform | Tilli
description: Tilli - Complete billing & payment platform with tilliX (self-service portal), Nudge (CPaaS for SMS/email/WhatsApp), and tilliPay (PCI-compliant payments). Reduce costs 40%, accelerate payments 3X.
keywords: tilliX self-service portal, Nudge CPaaS platform, tilliPay payment processing, enterprise billing software, digital bill presentment
hasOtpModal: true
hasVtigerIntegration: true
structuredData: >
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Tilli",
    "url": "https://www.tilli.pro/",
    "description": "Transform your business with Tilli's integrated payment and communication platform.",
    "logo": "https://www.tilli.pro/images/logo.png"
  }
---

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-text">
                <div class="hero-banner">
                    <span class="hero-banner-text">Check out whats new with tilli</span>
                    <span class="hero-banner-x">X</span>
                    <svg class="hero-banner-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <defs>
                            <linearGradient id="arrowGradient" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
                                <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#448DE6;stop-opacity:1" />
                                <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:#98B2E9;stop-opacity:1" />
                            </linearGradient>
                        </defs>
                        <path d="M6 3L11 8L6 13" stroke="url(#arrowGradient)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>

                <h1>Transform Billing Into <span class="highlight-word">Engagement</span>.</h1>
                <p>Go 100% Digital. Save 40% on Costs. Get Paid Faster.</p>

                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-large btn-icon" onclick="event.preventDefault(); event.stopPropagation(); window.openBookingModal(); return false;">
                        Book a Demo <span class="arrow-circle">→</span>
                    </button>
                    <a href="/calculator/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-large">Calculate ROI</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-visual">
                <img class="hero-image" src="/Images/Section.png" alt="Tilli Billing Platform" />
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Key Stats Section -->
    <section class="stats-section" style="background: #ffffff; padding: 60px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
        <div class="container">
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 3rem; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div style="font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 600; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #325ef6 0%, #60a5fa 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">4.8/5</div>
                    <div style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 16px;">Customer Rating</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div style="font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 600; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #325ef6 0%, #60a5fa 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">99.99%</div>
                    <div style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 16px;">Uptime SLA</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div style="font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 600; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #325ef6 0%, #60a5fa 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">40%</div>
                    <div style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 16px;">Cost Reduction</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div style="font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 600; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #325ef6 0%, #60a5fa 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">3X</div>
                    <div style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 16px;">Faster Payments</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-item">
                    <div style="font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 600; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #325ef6 0%, #60a5fa 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">80%+</div>
                    <div style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 16px;">Digital Adoption</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Trusted By Section -->
    <section class="trusted-by">
        <div class="container">
            <p class="trusted-text" style="font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3;">Supporting business across the globe</p>
            <div class="logos-track">
                <img src="/Images/howard-county-logo.png" alt="Howard County" style="height: 100px;">
                <img src="/Images/frontier-logo.png" alt="Frontier" style="height: 100px;">
                <img src="/Images/washington-gas-logo.png" alt="Washington Gas" style="height: 100px;">
                <img src="/Images/consolidated-edison-logo.png" alt="Con Edison" style="height: 100px;">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Products Section -->
    <section id="products" class="products-section" style="padding: 80px 0; background: #f9fafb;">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 60px;">Our Products</h2>
            <div class="products-grid-container" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem;">
                {% for product in products %}
                <div class="product-card" style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                    <div class="product-icon" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        {{ product.icon | safe }}
                    </div>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">{{ product.name }}</h3>
                    <p style="color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 1rem;">{{ product.tagline }}</p>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 1rem;">{{ product.description }}</p>
                    {% if product.metrics %}
                    <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                        {% for metric in product.metrics %}
                        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
                            <svg style="width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0;" fill="none" stroke="#4099FF" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                            </svg>
                            <span style="font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563;">{{ metric }}</span>
                        </div>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                    {% else %}
                    <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"></div>
                    {% endif %}
                    <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="product-link" style="color: #4099FF; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;">
                        Learn More →
                    </a>
                </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="cta-section" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #325ef6 0%, #4099FF 100%); padding: 80px 0; color: white; text-align: center;">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 style="font-size: 48px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Ready to Save Millions on Billing Operations?</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 20px; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Join enterprise clients reducing costs by 40% while accelerating payments 3X.</p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <a href="/signup/" class="btn btn-large" style="background: white; color: #325ef6; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">
                    Start Free Trial
                </a>
                <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-large btn-outline" style="border: 2px solid white; color: white; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">
                    Contact Sales
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
